fix prod all npt temp 960 ${T0} 0.2 z 0.0 0.0 2.0
fix prod all npt temp 960 960 0.2 z 0.0 0.0 2.0
fix          avg all ave/time 100 10 1000 v_fsol
thermo_style custom step temp press pzz pe enthalpy lz v_fsol
dump         d all custom 25000 coexist_${ens}_${pot}_${T0}.dump id x y z c_cna
dump         d all custom 25000 coexist_npt_${pot}_${T0}.dump id x y z c_cna
